    <item>
        <title>Peninsula 1.0.8</title>
        <pubDate>Wed, 07 Jan 2026 14:35:07 +0000</pubDate>
        <sparkle:version>1.0.8</sparkle:version>
        <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.8</sparkle:shortVersionString>
        <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
        <description><![CDATA[
            <h2>What's New in 1.0.8</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>Fix: Remove deprecated --deep flag and set default keychain</li> <li></li> <li>Critical fixes for codesign hanging in CI:</li> <li></li> <li>1. Remove --deep flag (deprecated, causes hangs)</li> <li>   - Apple document: '--deep Considered Harmful'</li> <li>   - Sign components individually from innermost to outermost</li> <li>   - XPC services -> nested apps -> binaries -> frameworks -> main app</li> <li></li> <li>2. Set temporary keychain as default</li> <li>   - Added: security default-keychain -s $KEYCHAIN_PATH</li> <li>   - Ensures codesign finds the certificate without prompts</li> <li></li> <li>3. Add codesign to certificate ACL during import</li> <li>   - Added: -T /usr/bin/codesign flag to security import</li> <li>   - Prevents GUI prompts in headless CI environment</li> <li></li> <li>References:</li> <li>- https://github.com/beeware/briefcase/issues/1221 (--deep deprecated)</li> <li>- https://github.com/tauri-apps/tauri-action/issues/941 (CI hanging)</li> <li>- https://developer.apple.com/forums/thread/712005 (errSecInternalComponent)</li> <li>- https://byteable.medium.com/creating-a-temporary-keychain-for-your-build-system-e598628c65fd</li> 
            </ul>
        ]]></description>
        <enclosure
            url="https://github.com/sidkaria/Peninsula-Updates/releases/download/v1.0.8/Peninsula.dmg"
            sparkle:edSignature="8rwK7g1eVcY0ZZKVQPjdjq+vxUS3OwDCd8Da3RjglPvjXRo2iK4yEDGHO/GhOxu8b7s6+RBt9zzhZB3Sl9g1DA=="
            length="3799116"
            type="application/octet-stream"
        />
